Equipment "1" -- "0..*" Process : 处理设备
Process "1" *-- "1..*" PackCycle : 本轮包次
Pack "1" -- "0..*" PackCycle : 历轮处理
Process "1" *-- "0..*" Monitor : 处理监测
Visit "1" -- "0..*" InstrumentUse : 关联就诊
Process "0..1" -- "0..*" Process : 异常后重新处理
Process "0..1" -- "0..*" FollowIssue : 器械异常
PackCycle "1" *-- "0..*" InstrumentUse : 本轮使用经历

